.SS "\fBResult\fP SystemEx\&.Threading\&.LockedObject< T >\&.ReadValue (\fBTimeOut\fP timeoutms)"

.PP
Reads the protected value using the underlying lock\&. The operation may block for up to \fItimeoutms\fP  milliseconds depending on the lock implementation\&. The returned \fBResult\fP typically contains the value at index \fR0\fP, but implementations may include additional diagnostic information\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fItimeoutms\fP The timeout in milliseconds\&. A value of \fR-1\fP indicates an infinite wait\&. 
.RE
.PP
